{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_01_end",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_01",
  "title": "日正當中",
  "storyCode": "GT-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "35bf19a4d03456e9e483ce6ba8905d4d87be8b791774d4ca7aac3cea73f589c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走廊好黑！而且好擠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不好意思，雖然方便藏身，但畢竟這裡只是個小閣樓而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "磨坊，糧倉，電房，村子裡的很多設施都被賞金獵人破壞了，他們不會在乎這種小地方的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這樣沒錯......唔，我們兩個居然剛好能擠進這種縫隙裡？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可蘿爾，臉是不是貼的太近了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉......那個，騎警大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別叫我騎警大人啦，叫我格拉尼就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，格拉尼，你剛才說你接到了我們村子希望找到騎士寶藏的委託......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "對，而且委託裡還提到，你確實已經擁有完整的寶藏資訊了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打開寶藏必要的鑰匙和寶藏的位置，都是歷代村長口口相傳的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "具體的我暫時還不能說......抱歉，我不是有意要向你隱瞞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "沒問題的，至少等到你完全相信我之後再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些賞金獵人得知了這些情報，就一直在威脅著村民們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們破壞村子的田地，搶走越冬的儲糧，騷擾村民——如果那時我不站出來，村子就真的要完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要讓他們知道寶藏的情報在我這裡，至少他們不再去傷害其他村民們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#5",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "但就算你受了那樣的苦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯，我很清楚，這不過是權宜之計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好，你來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#4",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "嗚，可蘿爾小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然委託內容是希望有人能來幫我們找到寶藏，但其實我們希望的也只是驅逐那些賞金獵人、讓村子恢復安寧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寶藏對我們來說，是現在唯一的解決手段而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "金幣什麼的，總會有花光的一天，但我們要一直在這片土地上生活下去，土地是我們唯一的故鄉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "用寶藏去雇傭別人驅逐賞金獵人，也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "有足夠的活動資金的話，甚至能雇傭一小支傭軍呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "既然目的已經明確，那當務之急，果然還是要先離開這個滿是流氓的村子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "這邊有窗子，能看到外——呃，好像有點高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可蘿爾小姐，你能試試從這個窗戶看到外面嗎，賞金獵人還在找我們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我也勾不到，窗戶還是太高了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#2",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "讓我抱你起來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#3",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "嘿！現在能看到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，我能看到了————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerToken": "char_220_grani#1",
      "operatorId": "char_220_grani",
      "portraitKey": "char_220_grani",
      "text": "可蘿爾小姐！別亂動呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可、可那個，那是什麼呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_003",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才，有個人，從窗戶外飛了過去......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
